        {
          "book": "EZK",
          "chapter": 47,
          "verse": 3
        }
      ],
      "en": "When the man went out eastward with the line in his hand, he measured one thousand cubits, and he caused me to pass through the waters, waters that were to the ankles.",
      "ko": "그 사람이 손에 줄을 잡고 동으로 나아가며 일천척을 척량한 후에 나로 그 물을 건너게 하시니 물이 발목에 오르더니",
      "source_text_hash": "ba33ff6f19818cf3d407d71df85d0800fdf3170e19879923cd4331ad9e8ce0e0",
      "translation_text_hash": "91425e64aa579b4e259edca24e21990c9b39adc88cc69b4649afd390b4236af3",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
