      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "EZK",
          "chapter": 47,
          "verse": 7
        }
      ],
      "en": "Now when I had returned, behold, on the bank of the river were very many trees on the one side and on the other.",
      "ko": "내가 돌아간즉 강 좌우편에 나무가 심히 많더라",
      "source_text_hash": "43556fe434290d7fc494eddea39de0d8f0c660287e2216447132c78b9572de21",
      "translation_text_hash": "dcc6ece0f8c7a487be761b502768d639557a7681240dda05025f838654786dd3",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "내가 돌아간즉 강 좌우편에 나무가 심히 많더라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "dcc6ece0f8c7a487be761b502768d639557a7681240dda05025f838654786dd3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:EZK:47:8",
      "sequence": 21688,
      "chapter_label": "EZK 47",
      "verse_label": "8",
      "locator": {
