      "en": "“So you shall divide this land to yourselves according to the tribes of Israel.",
      "ko": "그런즉 너희가 이스라엘 모든 지파대로 이 땅을 나누어 차지하라",
      "source_text_hash": "ded3c89bf48b4ef3fb6ccf3f23fc617c300563873fbda1a3ddfbdcb2c8275d78",
      "translation_text_hash": "3058c6da48bed5ac0f93367dcf41c3ad97e0a83690a285fa39fd50128b1e1954",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
